Modification notice: SpectralShift runtime logic has been extracted and adapted
onto the public base identified in docs/base_manifest.json. The patch adds split
projection execution, centered alpha scaling, optimizer multipliers, checkpoint
metadata and DDP synchronization. It reorganizes training helpers and provides
both fused-norm and plain projection module specs without CLI registration.

The original training repository, its history, machine paths, model checkpoints,
training data and manuscript PDF are not bundled. Source correspondence is
recorded in docs/code_logic.md and docs/source_manifest.json.
